   oxydized cholesterol and treated with nystatin. The experimental data
   were smoothed and then fitted to a mixture of Gaussian functions using
   the maximum likelihood method; the best fit was to a mixture of four
   gaussians centered approximately at 4, 6, 9 and 12 molecules per pore,
