Abstract = {It was analyzed the genetic effects of potassium dichromate and chromium
   trioxide in Drosophila melanogaster males treated with different
   concentrations of the salts. K2Cr2O7 was less toxic than CrO3. Potassium
   dichromate induced sex-chromosome loss and non-disjunction at the
