Abstract = {We explore some properties of cocyclic modules and rings. We establish
   when every cyclic module is cocyclic. In addition, we characterize the
   case in which every cocyclic module embeds in a free module. Finally, we
   give necessary conditions for a class of cocyclic modules to be closed
   under quotients and projective covers.},
