Month = {JUL},
Abstract = {The experimental examination applied in the 40th International Physics
   Olympiad held in Merida, Yucatan, Mexico, is presented. The examination
   consisted of two parts: (1) based on the measurements of a diffraction
   pattern produced by a diode laser impinging on a sharp edge of a razor
   blade, the students were asked to estimate the wavelength of the laser.
   (2) By using the same experimental setup, the contestants had to measure
   the birefringence of a mica film. For completeness, we give a brief
   description of the theoretical test. Finally, we present the
   distribution of marks and show, on the world map, with different
   colours, the performance of various countries.},
